@* Decision 0011 (run W2, WU9): the mockups' _FolderBrowser: the browser can't open a native folder dialog for the host, so the server lists
   folders (GET /api/settings/folders?path=, FolderBrowser: drives at the top on Windows, no hidden or system folders, at most 500) and
   settings-forms.js renders the crumbs and rows with textContent. "Use this folder" fills the working directory field. Model: none. *@
<div class="collapse" id="folderBrowser" data-folder-browser>
  <div class="ps-panel mt-3">
    <nav class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-1 px-3 py-2 border-bottom ps-mono fs-8" aria-label="Folder path" data-folder-crumbs></nav>
    <div class="list-group list-group-flush rounded-0 fs-7 folder-list" data-folder-list>
      <div class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-ps-faint">Loading…</div>
    </div>
    <div class="px-3 py-2 border-top fs-8 text-ps-warn" data-folder-error hidden></div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 border-top">
      <span class="ps-mono fs-8 text-ps-faint text-break" data-folder-current></span>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ms-auto" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#folderBrowser">Cancel</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" type="button" data-folder-use disabled>Use this folder</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
